@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `ito-rounding-order-nouns`
IMPORT `ito-rounding-order-5746`

-- Income Tax Ordinance [New Version], s 120B(d): the Minister's power to make rules for rounding the
-- amounts that s 120B adjusts, and the Order made under it.
-- Quotations (`src:N`) are copied mechanically from line N of
-- ../../registers/source-bundle/income-tax-ordinance-new-version.he.wiki.txt (sha256 b87f2cf4...6b81b6).
--
-- WHAT (d) DOES. It says the Minister of Finance "may set rules for rounding amounts adjusted under
-- this section", and an editorial note after it records that the Rounding Order 5746-1986 was
-- published. (d) states no rule of its own; the rule is the Order's (ito-rounding-order-5746.l4).
-- This module is the join: it takes an amount adjusted under s 120B and the kind it is, and
-- gives the figure in force, which is the figure s 120B(e)(1) calls "after rounding under (d)".
-- It is the rule row IL-03 declines for want of it (IL-03 NOTES, ito-120b-indexation.l4
-- `the rounding rules made under section 120B(d) are not encoded in this model`). Row IL-03 is
-- not edited; its module can call these rules.

§ `Section 120B(d) — rounding`

-- src:4341 | (ד) שר האוצר רשאי לקבוע כללים לעיגול סכומים שתואמו לפי סעיף זה.
-- src:4342 | [note: פורסם צו מס הכנסה (כללים לעיגול סכומים), התשמ״ו–1986.]
@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 120B(d) (source lines 4341-4342); Rounding Order 5746-1986
GIVEN `the amount adjusted under section 120B, before rounding` IS A NUMBER
      `the kind`                                                IS AN `An amount that section 120B adjusts, or that the Rounding Order rounds`
      r                                                         IS A `A reading of an amount the Rounding Order has no rule for`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 120B(d) — the amount after rounding` `the amount adjusted under section 120B, before rounding` `, of the kind` `the kind` `, reading an amount the Order has no rule for as` r MEANS
    `the Order rounds the adjusted amount` `the amount adjusted under section 120B, before rounding` `as an amount of the kind` `the kind` `, reading an amount it has no rule for as` r

@ref Income Tax Ordinance s 120B(d) (source lines 4341-4342); Rounding Order 5746-1986; fork R1
GIVEN `the amount adjusted under section 120B, before rounding` IS A NUMBER
      `the kind`                                                IS AN `An amount that section 120B adjusts, or that the Rounding Order rounds`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 120B(d) — the amount after rounding` `the amount adjusted under section 120B, before rounding` `, of the kind` `the kind` MEANS
    `s 120B(d) — the amount after rounding` `the amount adjusted under section 120B, before rounding` `, of the kind` `the kind`
        `, reading an amount the Order has no rule for as` `rounding — the reading this row takes for an amount the Order has no rule for`
